PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;
BEGIN;

-- Quranic passages as the book quotes them, checked page by page. Where the
-- book quotes part of a verse, the same words are cut from the Mushaf text
-- (quran.ar.uthmani.v2), so the Uthmani spelling is untouched; whole verses
-- and surahs the book names stay QuranText. Supplications the book writes in
-- its own words («اللهم آتنا…») are plain text, not verses.

